  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cbb0e39c2b673eb44a8e0e49af9a10f8, type: 2}
    textENG: Ah, I see you've visited the Lab House.
    textPL: "O, widz\u0119, \u017Ce odwiedzi\u0142e\u015B Lab House."
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cbb0e39c2b673eb44a8e0e49af9a10f8, type: 2}
    textENG: Please, return there and speak with my lost bro, Violet.
    textPL: "Prosz\u0119, wr\xF3\u0107 tam i porozmawiaj z moim zaginionym bratem
      Violet."
    expressionName: 
